346	     * unified {@code memberId}. Routing the audit event through this single accessor keeps the audit
347	     * trail's notion of the owner's identity in one place.
348	     *
349	     * @param owner the freshly created owner, already stamped with its {@code memberId}
350	     * @return the owner's primary identifier
351	     */
