624	     * owner with an address taken from the request, so routing that through this single method keeps the
625	     * derivation of "the owner's address" in one place, mirroring {@link #householdIdFor} for the
626	     * household id.
627	     *
628	     * @param ownerFieldsDto the submitted owner fields
629	     * @return the address to store on the owner
630	     */
631	    private String addressFor(OwnerFieldsDto ownerFieldsDto) {
632	        return ownerFieldsDto.getAddress();
