636	     * Derives the household id an owner should carry from its submitted fields (see
637	     * {@link HouseholdNormalizer#toHouseholdId}). Both create and update stamp an owner with a
638	     * household id, so routing them through this single method keeps them agreed on which of the
639	     * owner's fields key the household.
640	     *
641	     * @param ownerFieldsDto the submitted owner fields (its identifying fields are non-blank here,
642	     *                       {@link #rejectBlankOwnerFields} having already run on create)
643	     * @return the owner's household id
644	     */
645	    private String householdIdFor(OwnerFieldsDto ownerFieldsDto) {
646	        return HouseholdNormalizer.toHouseholdId(
647	            ownerFieldsDto.getLastName(), ownerFieldsDto.getPostcode());
648	    }
